WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.515
Where the first people stood.

00:02.310 --> 00:06.855
You are standing at Tranquility Base, where people first walked on another world.

00:07.454 --> 00:14.771
The ground is the shape a camera in orbit measured, at its true height, and the descent stage stands where it was photographed.
